<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Jabil Circuit target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Jabil Circuit target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities raised its price target on Jabil Circuit Inc to $49 from $42 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Jabil has been very aggressive in adding new customers and attracting new business.</p>
<p>-- For the second quarter ending in February, NatWest expects Jabil's earnings per share to increase about 40 percent over last year.</p>
<p>-- Jabil gained 1-5/8 to 40-1/4 in late morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
